    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601210/extras/e143d2aa6842b79460e2951bd2979cf0.avif?t=1745224197\" width=424 height=188 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HARD. UNFAIR. ADDICTIVE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Donald Jump</strong> is a brutal, one-button <strong>precision platformer</strong> that will push your reflexes and patience to the limit. You've got <strong>just 10 lives</strong> to survive <strong>50 devious levels</strong> designed to crush your spirit (but somehow keep you hitting restart anyway). Can you out-jump the chaos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601210/extras/9a97ee65400d8d379e278eaf36ac1999.poster.avif?t=1745224197\" width=128 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601210/extras/9a97ee65400d8d379e278eaf36ac1999.webm?t=1745224197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONE BUTTON. ENDLESS PAIN.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple to learn, impossible to master \u2014 with just one button, you\u2019ll leap, bounce, and fumble through hazards, traps, and rage-inducing gaps. Every pixel matters. Every frame counts. Perfect for fans of games that punish mistakes but reward perseverance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601210/extras/b86440ba5614dd0b546b13169f6713b1.avif?t=1745224197\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe5 <strong>50 hand-crafted, punishing levels</strong><br>\ud83d\udfe5 <strong>20 lives</strong>... total. That\u2019s it. Lose them all? Back to the start. <br>\ud83d\udfe5 <strong>Tight one-button controls</strong><br>\ud83d\udfe5 <strong>No checkpoints. No mercy. Pure platforming.</strong><br>\ud83d\udfe5 A throwback to the hardest arcade and indie platformers<br>\ud83d\udfe5 <strong>Perfect for speedrunners, masochists, and leaderboard chasers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601210/extras/41e4be90d293fce092c94fe20852a20c.avif?t=1745224197\" width=64 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601210/extras/52eb3d1f11bcaf23848c564aa0f89780.avif?t=1745224197\" width=64 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601210/extras/450de570233e8dadd1d00dab6220c356.avif?t=1745224197\" width=64 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601210/extras/6373eee95b670ae17a493dfe30008fba.avif?t=1745224197\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECTIBLE SKINS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your chaos! Unlock a variety of quirky and ridiculous skins. Each is a political parody and a badge of honor earned through sheer perseverance (or stubbornness). Can you unlock them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe5 <strong>Earn skins by collecting coins</strong><br>\ud83d\udfe5 <strong>A mix of funny, weird, and thematic characters</strong><br>\ud83d\udfe5 <strong>Show off your favorite look as you rage against the levels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601210/extras/f7d92a0afd6f649b59302618471c6097.poster.avif?t=1745224197\" width=128 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601210/extras/f7d92a0afd6f649b59302618471c6097.webm?t=1745224197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WILL YOU MAKE THE JUMP?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most players won\u2019t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601210/extras/f3b2c8572e83b373c87d9e9bc6e91344.avif?t=1745224197\" width=800 height=355 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601210/extras/e143d2aa6842b79460e2951bd2979cf0.avif?t=1745224197\" width=424 height=188 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HARD. UNFAIR. ADDICTIVE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Donald Jump</strong> is a brutal, one-button <strong>precision platformer</strong> that will push your reflexes and patience to the limit. You've got <strong>just 10 lives</strong> to survive <strong>50 devious levels</strong> designed to crush your spirit (but somehow keep you hitting restart anyway). Can you out-jump the chaos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601210/extras/9a97ee65400d8d379e278eaf36ac1999.poster.avif?t=1745224197\" width=128 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601210/extras/9a97ee65400d8d379e278eaf36ac1999.webm?t=1745224197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONE BUTTON. ENDLESS PAIN.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple to learn, impossible to master \u2014 with just one button, you\u2019ll leap, bounce, and fumble through hazards, traps, and rage-inducing gaps. Every pixel matters. Every frame counts. Perfect for fans of games that punish mistakes but reward perseverance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601210/extras/b86440ba5614dd0b546b13169f6713b1.avif?t=1745224197\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe5 <strong>50 hand-crafted, punishing levels</strong><br>\ud83d\udfe5 <strong>20 lives</strong>... total. That\u2019s it. Lose them all? Back to the start. <br>\ud83d\udfe5 <strong>Tight one-button controls</strong><br>\ud83d\udfe5 <strong>No checkpoints. No mercy. Pure platforming.</strong><br>\ud83d\udfe5 A throwback to the hardest arcade and indie platformers<br>\ud83d\udfe5 <strong>Perfect for speedrunners, masochists, and leaderboard chasers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601210/extras/41e4be90d293fce092c94fe20852a20c.avif?t=1745224197\" width=64 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601210/extras/52eb3d1f11bcaf23848c564aa0f89780.avif?t=1745224197\" width=64 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601210/extras/450de570233e8dadd1d00dab6220c356.avif?t=1745224197\" width=64 height=64 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601210/extras/6373eee95b670ae17a493dfe30008fba.avif?t=1745224197\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECTIBLE SKINS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your chaos! Unlock a variety of quirky and ridiculous skins. Each is a political parody and a badge of honor earned through sheer perseverance (or stubbornness). Can you unlock them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe5 <strong>Earn skins by collecting coins</strong><br>\ud83d\udfe5 <strong>A mix of funny, weird, and thematic characters</strong><br>\ud83d\udfe5 <strong>Show off your favorite look as you rage against the levels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601210/extras/f7d92a0afd6f649b59302618471c6097.poster.avif?t=1745224197\" width=128 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601210/extras/f7d92a0afd6f649b59302618471c6097.webm?t=1745224197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WILL YOU MAKE THE JUMP?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most players won\u2019t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601210/extras/f3b2c8572e83b373c87d9e9bc6e91344.avif?t=1745224197\" width=800 height=355 /></span></p>",
